      "value": "I think VRChat's gone back and forth on this. Initially the camera would always take a picture when using the trigger, then it didn't for awhile, and I'd have to turn on that trigger takes photo every... world or launch of VRChat (can't recall which of those two). Recently the camera works properly so I haven't given it much thought. \n\nOne thing I'd suggest trying is try taking a picture with the lense of the camera. Personally I hit the fly toggle twice, but there are other ways to separate the camera preview from its lense.",
